# Normalise line endings on checkout, on every platform.
#
# biome.json pins `lineEnding: "lf"` (as .prettierrc pinned `endOfLine: "lf"` before it),
# so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF working files that `pnpm format`
# then rejects on every file. CI never sees this because the runners check out LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mcpb binary
*.node binary
